    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Submissions a minute, by status",
      "description": "201: accepted, memberships active. 202: stored, activation not confirmed yet. 503: not confirmed at all, so the client resubmits. The API docs list the rest.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "60 * sum by (http_response_status_code) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"FunBooksAndVideos.Api\", http_route=\"v1/purchase-orders\", http_request_method=\"POST\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_response_status_code}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 9,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Time to the answer, and to the last step, p95",
      "description": "The answer: how long a client waits, BR1's activation included. The last step: from the workflow's start to CompleteOrder, after the shipping slip. The gap between them is the work done after the client heard back.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"FunBooksAndVideos.Api\", http_route=\"v1/purchase-orders\", http_request_method=\"POST\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "the answer"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(temporal_workflow_endtoend_latency_milliseconds_bucket{job=\"FunBooksAndVideos.Worker\"}[1m]))) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "the last step"
        }
      ],
      "id": 10,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Fulfilment",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "id": 11,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Steps a second, by activity",
      "description": "Every order runs AcceptOrder and CompleteOrder. ActivateMembership runs for an order with a membership (BR1), GenerateShippingSlip for one with a physical product (BR2).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (activity_type) (rate(temporal_activity_execution_latency_milliseconds_count{job=\"FunBooksAndVideos.Worker\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{activity_type}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 12,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Failed attempts a minute, by activity",
      "description": "Each failed attempt is retried until it succeeds (ADR 4). Two orders racing for one customer fail ActivateMembership once, by design (ADR 5); a steady stream means SQL or the network is down. The logs below say why.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (activity_type) (increase(temporal_activity_execution_failed_total{job=\"FunBooksAndVideos.Worker\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{activity_type}}"
        }
      ],
      "id": 13,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Workers",
      "collapsed": false,
